---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
---
<Platform title="Promote your project" description="Follow the steps to request a reviewed promotional feature on Digivated and @digivatedx.">
<header class="page-intro promo-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Included with Founding Membership</p><h1>One featured submission comes with membership.</h1><p class="lede">Founding Membership includes one featured project submission, with no extra payment. Sign in, then send the project. Review is required, and a feature is never guaranteed. The standalone promo spot is still available.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://digivated.gumroad.com/l/founding-member-pass" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get Founding Membership</a><a class="button" href="/submit-project?membership=1#project-form">Submit the included feature</a></div><p class="quiet">Membership: $5 USD once for the first 25 members. Featured spot without membership: $3 USD once. Review required either way. Applicable taxes and purchase terms are shown on Gumroad.</p></header>
<section class="promo-steps" aria-labelledby="promo-steps-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Included with Founding Membership</p><h2 id="promo-steps-title">Three clear steps.</h2></div><ol><li><div><h3>Get Founding Membership</h3><p>Membership is $5 USD once for the first 25 members. It includes full carousels, the full Prompt Packet, and one featured submission. It is not a subscription.</p><a href="https://digivated.gumroad.com/l/founding-member-pass" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get Founding Membership ↗</a></div></li><li><div><h3>Sign in, then send the project</h3><p>Use the license key or purchase email from your receipt. Then choose “Included with Founding Membership” on the submission form. Add a working link and a clear description.</p><a href="/submit-project?membership=1#project-form">Submit the included feature →</a></div></li><li><div><h3>Wait for review</h3><p>Digivated reviews the project before anything is public. One request per membership, with no extra payment. A feature is never guaranteed.</p></div></li></ol></section>
<section class="promo-details" aria-label="Before you purchase"><div><h2>Know what to expect.</h2><p>A purchase starts the promotion process. It does not instantly publish your project or guarantee views, likes, followers, clicks, or sales.</p><p>Keep your receipt and follow the instructions in your Gumroad purchase. For purchase questions, reply to that receipt to contact the seller.</p></div><div><h2>Looking for a regular listing?</h2><p>You can also submit a project for ordinary directory review for free. Paid promotion is a separate request and requires the Gumroad purchase.</p><a class="button" href="/submit-project#project-form">Submit for free review</a></div></section>
<section class="promo-details" aria-label="Included with Founding Membership"><div><h2>Included with Founding Membership</h2><p>Members can submit one featured request through the project form. There is no second payment. Digivated still reviews the project, and a feature is never guaranteed.</p><a class="button" href="/founding-members#member-sign-in">Sign in, then submit</a></div><div><h2>Prefer the standalone spot?</h2><p>The $3 promotional purchase is still available. Buy it on Gumroad, then submit with your receipt.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://digivated.gumroad.com/l/digivated-promo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View promo offer on Gumroad</a><a class="button" href="/submit-project?promotion=1#project-form">Already purchased? Submit your project</a></div></div></section>
<section class="promo-ready"><div><h2>Ready to send the included feature?</h2><p>Sign in with your membership first. One request per membership, and it stays private until review.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="/submit-project?membership=1#project-form">Continue to submission →</a></section>
</Platform>

